  "content": {
    "_uid": "02d66116-5ce0-e1f2-6de3-1dbb6eb6f76a",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "9ce2ac0c-1d49-6da7-af94-7b42d495a9c8",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Not only is the ambubag an inefficient device but its use can also be distressing for those involved. During the three-day Hackathon in 2016, Team Breath Hacks developed a low-cost mechanical pump that automated the previously manual process. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
