    "show_share": true,
    "description": "At AKU's first-ever Hackathon, a group of 8 faculty and students, Team Breath Hacks, developed a low cost prototype for a challenge that hits every emergency room: the high demand for life-saving ventilators. The alternative to a ventilator is an inflatable ambubag with medical staff and even relatives having to manually pump air to help a patient breathe - often for hours on end.",
